{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "272P2SSSRAY2VSRCYXODZGFIKG5XG7SS",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "090056001",
    "title": "資料保管室を調査せよ！",
    "enTitle": "Investigate the Archive Room!",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（――捜査の基本は張り込み。\nこの位置ならば、資料保管室の入口がしっかりと見渡せるな）",
            "enText": "(——A careful lookout is the basis of any good investigation… \nAnd this spot gives me a clear view of the school archive's \nentrance.)",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 218,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 278,
                    "pathId": -9043658383422940679
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 214,
                    "pathId": -8616206196479147129
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 376,
                    "pathId": -8252293563269443876
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": -324382460421908881
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 358,
                    "pathId": 7999481299998298594
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5050255477875430538,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（先日、私は風紀委員会から、ある特命任務を拝命した。\nそれは――資料保管室の実態調査）",
            "enText": "(I received special orders from the Disciplinary Committee the \nother day. My mission: To investigate the school archive.)",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 299,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 12,
                    "pathId": 5680558074905213271
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 12,
                    "pathId": -8253905921944068995
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 12,
                    "pathId": 7807384293105979510
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 12,
                    "pathId": 921321507871223324
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 12,
                    "pathId": 404814582680068063
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2354423731904331333,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "風紀委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "Disciplinary Committee Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "最近、資料保管室に忍び込んでいる生徒がいるの。しかも複数名。\n保管室には昔の貴重な資料もあるから、施錠しているのに……。",
            "enText": "We've had students sneaking into the archive room recently<i>. </i>\nMultiple students. This is despite the fact the door is locked \nto protect the precious documents inside…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 340,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 692,
                    "pathId": 8063657666282865393
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6090614939625330868,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "不法侵入ではありませんか！　資料の破損などが起きてからでは\n遅い。事件を未然に防ぐのが我々の職務であります！",
            "enText": "Why, that's criminal trespassing! We cannot afford to have those \ndocuments damaged. It is our duty as the Disciplinary Committee \nto prevent a disaster before it happens!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 275,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -2847857620197938008
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 8159704356062399303
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3060649906875648146,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（誰が、どんな方法で、何を目的に保管室へ忍び込んでいるのか――\nその実態を突き止める。トレセン学園の治安を守るために！）",
            "enText": "(Who are the trespassers? How are they entering the archives? \nWhat are their motives? If I am to maintain public order in the \nacademy, I need to find the answer to these questions!)",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 359,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": 7416122947857824429
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6789807470882509953
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 401,
                    "pathId": 1102152748490183091
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -4394833241789825501
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 3123028175188403838
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4981689017609758719,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（保管室の前で怪しい動きをする生徒がいたら、即、事情聴取だ！\nさあ来い、侵入者！）",
            "enText": "(The instant I spot someone engaging in suspicious activity, \nI will begin questioning! Now, come at me, intruders!)",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 273,
                    "pathId": -6647145173354628166
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1876640239276716604
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3957316288630433848,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "イベントタイトルロゴ表示。",
            "enText": "Event logo.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 236,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 271,
                    "pathId": -3912046432215928011
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7913004193588468382,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（おかしい……侵入者どころか、誰もここを通らない……！？）",
            "enText": "(That's odd… Not a single student is passing by, much less \nan intruder!)",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 202,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 276,
                    "pathId": 6777232206486720379
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7707621278991991258
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 363,
                    "pathId": 3835877607007056244
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6368263610166426945,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "通りすがりのウマ娘",
            "enName": "Horsegirl Passing By",
            "jpText": "うわ、フェノーメノだ。すっげー顔で睨んでる……\n前通ったら、絶対服装注意されるっしょ……反対側の階段からいこ。",
            "enText": "Yikes, Fenomeno alert. Aw man, look how she's glaring… \nIf she sees me, she's gonna be on my case about dress code… \n…Yeah, no thanks. I'm taking the other stairs.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 363,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 416,
                    "pathId": 1861826080175627921
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 262,
                    "pathId": 4959861397474439531
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 395,
                    "pathId": -6926179687169438913
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9098530362296980712,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "……もしかして、生徒が全然来ないのは……\n本官のせいでありますか！？",
            "enText": "……Wait… Is no one passing through here… \nBecause of <i>me!?</i>",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 302,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": -2335774028781168984
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": -1534261449108232925
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 395,
                    "pathId": 6359713790683658667
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8425453924597276989,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "あ、フェノーメノちゃんだ！　おーいっ、どうしたの？",
            "enText": "Oh, Fenomeno-chan! \nHeyyyy, what's up?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 139,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 2337698254779018491
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": 7696588467487617001
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 395,
                    "pathId": 470869899513563797
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": -4383662777603089567
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5090687880393586465
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 7368972541660837032
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 5722540056871102555
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4989725925415465043,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "へー、それで見張ってたんだ。資料保管室っていうと……\nいつも鍵がかかっている部屋だよね！　図書室の隣の――",
            "enText": "So <i>that's</i> why you're on watch. The archive room… \nThat's the one they keep locked up, right? \nRight next door to the school library——",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 341,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 398,
                    "pathId": -8499641091985558713
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7468619874189061344
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 5386334366621406101
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 171,
                    "pathId": -3759296840252397391
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": -6279929315193692798
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -882041051424712860,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "あれ……図書室？　そういえば、関係あるかわかんないけど……\n図書室で、ちょっと変な様子のブーちゃんを見かけたなぁ。",
            "enText": "Hang on… The library? Say, I don't know if this has anything \nto do with your thing… But I saw Buu-chan acting funny in there.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 398,
                    "pathId": 931047934657479427
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 255,
                    "pathId": 7071835930203460579
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 130,
                    "pathId": -2682449755387245813
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2383416271770749876,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ナリタブライアンさんですか？",
            "enText": "You mean Narita Brian-san?",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 48,
                    "pathId": 7809598383464887301
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -3025734599326928070
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 115,
                    "pathId": 8608884941403894741
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -8053993488944894060
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6030126632388124814,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "うん。ブーちゃんが珍しく、図書室の奥から出てきたの。\nなにしてたか訊いたんだけど、『オマエが知る必要はない』って。",
            "enText": "Yep. Buu-chan was all the way in the back, and she <i>never</i> goes \nback there. I asked what she was up to, but she was all \n\"I don't need to tell you.\"",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 307,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 2376053200785262146
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -2232833889356088220
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -4976772941599237786
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3018541918392461932
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": 6932211034650088897
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1007957031416819354
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5148325993217240375,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "けど、すっごく気になったから！\n教えてって追っかけ回したら、ブーちゃんも観念してさ。",
            "enText": "But that just made me curious! \nSo I kept bugging her about it, and eventually she tapped out.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 238,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 3614086947969782786
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -986804695393393802
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 2119542259302717844
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6638674450295959831,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "『本当に諦めないな、オマエは』って、\nようやく教えてくれたんだよね！",
            "enText": "She was like \"You really don't know when to quit,\" \nand finally told me what she was up to!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 8806262651621421715
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 224,
                    "pathId": -6445693927388500950
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": -1388843104256723330
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5008336233327404140,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "あのブライアンさんが応じてくれたのですか！\n――それで、彼女は何をしていたと？",
            "enText": "You managed to get an answer out of<i> Brian-san!? </i>\nSo, what was she doing there?",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 177,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 264,
                    "pathId": 3315730890498710913
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": -2854329250135653292
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 246,
                    "pathId": -2499701769282118862
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -7399310424050882247
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -8635149287761498635
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 2042734593765989860
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6328055697106055653,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サムソンビッグ",
            "enName": "Samson Big",
            "jpText": "『昼寝をしようと思ったんだが、残滓が騒々しい』って。",
            "enText": "\"I tried taking a nap there. \nCouldn't fall asleep with <b>the rest</b> making all that noise.\"",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 159,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 101,
                    "pathId": 3071177912863182485
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": 7860422196700304217
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": -7723261540223257566
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6369204620142447206,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "残滓……？　意味深ですね。ブライアンさんも気になりますが……\nまずは図書室の奥に何かあるのか、情報を集めましょう！",
            "enText": "\"The rest\"…? That is an intriguing choice of words. \nI'd like to ask Brian-san a few questions… But we should take \nstock of the back of the library first!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 337,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": 5140377695151236311
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5065761357388974576
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 331,
                    "pathId": 8360582526655872500
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 9028766296598049842
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3921896720417222369,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "――貴方、図書委員ですね？　事情聴取、よろしいですか。\nさる筋から風紀委員会にタレコミがありまして――",
            "enText": "Excuse me, ma'am, you are on librarian duty, correct? \nWould you mind if I asked you a few questions? The Disciplinary \nCommittee has a tip from an anonymous source that——",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 281,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 318,
                    "pathId": -4564838755614977705
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7291328717367686802
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 384,
                    "pathId": -8570710979144199198
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 285,
                    "pathId": 1713593516424963677
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3926119699745037909
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1478393703285867776,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "図書委員のウマ娘",
            "enName": "School Librarian Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ひいっ！？　すすすすみません、サボってたわけじゃないです！\n私は漫画の確認を！　これっ、本棚に戻しますので！　失礼します！",
            "enText": "Eek! I'm s-s-s-s-s-sorry, I'm not slacking off, honest! \nI'm just, uh, double-checking the manga section! I'm going to \ngo put this book back where it belongs, so, um, goodbye!",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 327,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 423,
                    "pathId": -6859461223931758131
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": -1432555535691123595
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 384,
                    "pathId": -613422796722727228
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 382,
                    "pathId": 8702085769338977130
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": 454816291265665610
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8080729094694979869,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "気弱そうなウマ娘",
            "enName": "Timid-looking Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "ご、ごめんなさい！　返却期限を過ぎた本を、こっそり戻しました！\nもうしません……すみませぇぇん！",
            "enText": "I- I'm sorry! I tried to get away with returning an overdue book \nwithout telling anyone! \nI swear I'll never do it again… Please, forgive meeeee!",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 272,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 556,
                    "pathId": 8949445246949715202
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 4785484710944229893
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -5619667875870790679
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 523,
                    "pathId": 7184692581579298760
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 6200486907700885923
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5103876068775755312,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "いえっ、咎めようとしたわけでは……ま、待って下さい！！\nうぐぐぐぐ……話のひとつも聞けないなんて！",
            "enText": "N-no, I'm not trying to blame you… W-wait, please!! \nArgh… I can't even get a word in!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 290,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": -3251696480870019824
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 331,
                    "pathId": 6328450902329896021
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 234,
                    "pathId": 8122333133075642249
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": -7216870431519697542
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5530459377029655386,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "フェノーメノさんどうしたの？\n困ってる？　誰かとお話ししたかったの？",
            "enText": "What's going on, Fenomeno-san? \nIs something wrong? \nWas there someone you wanted to talk to?",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 168,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 269,
                    "pathId": -5950219161905878093
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 240,
                    "pathId": -5433654545351006873
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 360,
